AltoERC4626RatioLinearDiscountOracle::updateLinearDiscountNode()
├── given caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
└── given caller is owner
    ├── when maturity is not in the future
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleLinearDiscountInvalidInput
    ├── when ptToken is zero address
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleLinearDiscountInvalidInput
    ├── when ptToken expiry does not match maturity
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleLinearDiscountInvalidInput
    ├── when baseDiscountPerYear exceeds MATH_PRECISION
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleLinearDiscountInvalidInput
    ├── when inDecimals + outDecimals exceeds 54
    │   └── it should revert with ModuleLinearDiscountInvalidInput
    ├── when node is valid
    │   ├── it should replace the existing linearDiscountNode
    │   ├── it should emit SetLinearDiscountNode with old and new node
    │   └── it should update linearDiscountNode storage correctly
    └── given current maturity has already passed
        └── when new node has a future maturity
            └── it should succeed and update linearDiscountNode
